{"v":4,"catch":"在像素風幻想RPG中，與靈獸掌控桌遊式成長！","desc":"一千年前，神祇創造了世界與六枚卵。由此誕生的靈獸被託付繁榮，卻反叛而起。神祇震怒，將其封印並消失，只留下人類、神之劍與希望之種。如今命運再起波瀾，新英雄崛起……\n\n體驗懷舊像素風RPG：經典回合制戰鬥、桌遊式成長系統與多樣自訂職業。收集道具、解鎖奇蹟技能，培育會隨劇情進化的靈獸夥伴。轉動輪盤、變強，揭開被封印的真相！","publisher":"KEMCO","release":"2026-11-26","genres":["角色扮演","冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"輔12歳級","size":"Switch 2 0.5GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/188c36180e04d8d219be399736dc5074b998606f3269e2adf93f0395b44a39f7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/79f264d5fe39d68e427249f7321d1c9303d2343de0328203c532d333da017394.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d2905236efdeb603dea3288f46faaec20a57493e96e19f9eeb87d0398877b590.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/54808e7c07d6263a03e2f77074aa4cb86586ee5ee0390314754f830ff9e3f626.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a9487fe0b7234e3f78d0482a1c10ba7ad9461333430c6df3e76b4b74d07ce83a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/74ea8280d03d278aad0a51735b577a17af1aa5cc366d696fd1a2b7340c38768f.jpg"],"titleId":"0100edc02609a000","dlc":[{"id":"70050000068891","name":"Experience x3 - Dragon Spira","img":"3e297e97811a3656d0b7a9993d5e669569235d8a390bace08424f8b6d5a69914","date":"2026-02-06","mem":false},{"id":"70050000068892","name":"JP x3 - Dragon Spira","img":"b482ef93a8049f92059dea0132dc0b5220a25e301a5dfc57ccdb90ca4a4b17b5","date":"2026-02-06","mem":false},{"id":"70050000068893","name":"Experience & JP x2 - Dragon Spira","img":"673ced0ab5337c450a7fa88b306e3b409ad6ecca566a087d3fef0ff12340daf1","date":"2026-02-06","mem":false},{"id":"70050000068894","name":"Damage x2 - Dragon Spira","img":"b105b8447cffdb4931a2e37c4720a79cd189fde01284a20a522cb772578e68a3","date":"2026-02-06","mem":false}]}